---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service" description="yaopulife DIY Terms of Service - General terms and conditions for purchases and custom orders.">
  <Navbar />

  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-gray-500">Last updated: May 13, 2026</p>

      <div class="mt-12 prose prose-lg text-gray-600">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>By accessing and using yaopulife.com, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, please do not use our services.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">2. Custom Orders</h2>
        <p>All custom products are made to order based on your specifications. A design preview will be sent for your approval before production begins. Once you approve the design, we begin crafting.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">3. Payment</h2>
        <p>We accept PayPal for all transactions. Payment must be received in full before production begins. Prices are listed in USD.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">4. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>You warrant that any images or content you provide for customization do not infringe on third-party intellectual property rights. We reserve the right to refuse designs that violate copyright or trademark.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>yaopulife DIY's liability is limited to the purchase price of the product. We are not liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">6. Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about these terms? Contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@yaopulife.com" class="text-brand-600">hello@yaopulife.com</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>